WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.060
What's up everybody!

00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:03.060
We are Pongfinity

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:04.620
And welcome to another episode of

00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:06.080
Challenge Pongfinity

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:07.379
This is the series where YOU

00:00:07.379 --> 00:00:08.540
Challenge US

00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:11.240
With your craziest ideas related to table
tennis.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.260
If your idea gets picked

00:00:13.269 --> 00:00:14.930
We'll feature it in our next video

00:00:14.930 --> 00:00:17.510
And give you a shout out.

00:00:17.510 --> 00:00:20.060
So make sure you leave your comments and ideas

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:22.900
In the comment-section below!

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:29.020
This one is from PokeExpert Thunderbolt

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:30.160
Let's do some push-ups!

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:17.680
Eric Primeau wants me to play against myself
while doing backspin.

00:01:20.320 --> 00:01:22.560
Let's see how many shots I can do!

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:02.880
Next one is from Dude that's amazingly perfect.

00:02:03.320 --> 00:02:04.909
We are going to play a rally of 10 shots

00:02:04.960 --> 00:02:06.880
On each of these 4 tables.

00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:42.960
Eryk Ozarowski suggests we should play with
a balloon.

00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:00.680
Thanks for watching guys!

00:04:01.520 --> 00:04:05.960
Hope you enjoyed this episode as much as this
horse enjoys me!

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:09.159
Remember to subscribe to our channel here

00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:12.680
And watch our previous videos there.

00:04:12.680 --> 00:04:14.480
Until next time!

